sequenceDiagram
    actor V as Visitor
    participant W as Widget
    participant API as POST /api/widget/chat
    participant RAG as RAG (hybrid_search)
    participant LLM as AI Provider

    V->>W: Asks a question outside the knowledge base
    W->>API: chat(public_key, visitor_id, message)
    API->>RAG: hybrid_search(query, knowledge_base_id)
    RAG-->>API: zero chunks matched
    Note over API: No LLM call — grounded-answer-only design
    API-->>W: "Couldn't find anything relevant..." (grounded=false, confidence=0)

    Note over API,LLM: Alternate path — chunks found but LLM/provider fails
    API->>LLM: generate answer from context
    LLM--xAPI: timeout / rate-limit / provider error
    API->>API: fall back to MockProvider (deterministic extractive answer)
    API-->>W: extractive answer stitched from top chunks
